    "regressions": [
      "Node and NACK encoding, opaque resource payload ownership and independent per-type version state",
      "resource count/bytes and envelope limits, malformed/truncated/invalid-UTF8 protobuf, unknown fields and scalar-last semantics",
      "desired-name copies, duplicate/capacity refusal and allocation failure sweeps",
      "ACK/NACK version/nonce state, superseded decisions, reset replay and cross-client token rejection",
      "real duplex two-stream exchange with wildcard/name subscription changes and wrong-type NACK",
      "ACK encoding allocation failure preserves accepted version and retries via flush",
      "constructor allocator sweeps preserve parent sender references",
      "occupied State mutex and expired/wrong-clock opening admission return Timeout without queueing or losing desired subscriptions",
      "short stream admission timeout leaves long-lived stream available for later discovery data",
      "independent official Envoy protobuf/grpc-js peer validates exact Node/Struct, nine requests, latest nonce and one HTTP/2 session across stream reconnect"
    ]
  },
